# Dockerfile.dashboard.dockerignore — build context for the dashboard image.
#
# BuildKit uses this file INSTEAD OF the root .dockerignore when building with
# `-f Dockerfile.dashboard` (it does not merge with it), so this file is
# deliberately self-contained.
#
# Strategy: deny everything, then re-include only the dashboard source plus the
# small set of read-only synthetic demonstration assets the image bakes in.
#
# Negation care: `**` excludes every path, so each required asset is re-included
# by its EXACT path, and its parent directories are re-included too — Docker
# will not descend into a directory that no rule re-includes.  Whole data or
# model directories are never re-included, so models/*.joblib (3 MB),
# data/processed/ (6 MB), mlruns/ (367 MB), and the MLflow database stay out.
#
# The dashboard holds NO model, NO MLflow database, and NO credential.  All
# predictions go to the API over CORALSENSE_API_URL.

# ── Deny everything ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
**

# ── Application source and configuration ─────────────────────────────────────
!src/
!params.yaml
!pyproject.toml
!requirements.txt
!.streamlit/

# ── Read-only synthetic demonstration assets (restored by `dvc pull` in CI) ──
# Required: every visualisation page calls load_observations().
!data/
!data/raw/
!data/raw/observations.csv
# Required: Model Performance and Overview pages call load_evaluation().
!models/
!models/evaluation_health.json
!models/evaluation_restoration.json
# Optional: Drift Monitoring and Governance pages degrade gracefully without it.
!reports/
!reports/drift_summary.json

# ── Re-exclude anything unwanted that the rules above would pull back in ─────
# Trained artifacts must never reach the dashboard image
models/*.joblib
data/processed/
data/reference/
data/production/
# Full Evidently HTML reports are large and only existence-checked by page 8
reports/*.html
# Caches and build residue
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
**/*.so
**/*.egg-info/
# Secrets must never enter the context, under any circumstances
.env
**/.env
.dvc/
.dvc/config.local
*.pem
*.key
# Editor and OS noise
**/.DS_Store
**/*.swp
